{"c":[{"name":"20260826T024233Z-b9bc41aef5017da0","text":"Each tox env runs pytest -n auto --maxprocesses=4; coverage stays serial. Serial markers: 0. Unbounded auto made tox run-parallel slower.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T030409Z-e8788d730d1e85ab","text":"pytest-xdist archived: each tox env is -n auto --maxprocesses=4; 0 serial markers; PR #66 closes #64.","type":"note"}]}
